+      "content": "You know the present subjunctive from A2 Unit 27 and the concessive connectors of this unit. There is a short way to say \"it makes no difference what, who, where or how\": repeat the verb in the subjunctive around a relative word. *Pase lo que pase* means \"whatever happens\". Spanish has no single word for \"whatever\" here, so it says \"may happen what may happen\". The rest of the sentence is what stays true: *Pase lo que pase, te voy a apoyar*."
